  "cell_contents": "Four nominal CF formula units in the conventional orthorhombic Pbnm cell. Electron-microprobe analysis gives Na0.88Al0.99Fe0.13Si0.94O4 per nominal formula unit; the positional model is the idealized isostructural Fe-free refinement deposited with the same article.",
